            "inLanguage": "en",
            "text": "The student edition is credited to José Ignacio Martín Gandul. Cite the title QCA/QW Atlas — student edition, the author, its public URL and the GitHub revision or access date used. It is a pedagogical guide; original research papers should be cited separately.",
